      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00370000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "感谢你帮忙找到了粉蝶蛹！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "611F8C224F605E2E5FD9627E52304E867C89877686F9FF0100100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们俩的粉蝶蛹……\n以防外一，我来数一下哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 2240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC4FE976847C89877686F920262026000A4EE5963259164E00FF0C6211676565704E004E0B54E6300200100002011401980000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "1……2……3……\n4……5……6……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 2296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "003120262026003220262026003320262026000A00342026202600352026202600362026202600100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "7……8……9……\n10……11……12……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 2344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "003720262026003820262026003920262026000A00310030202620260031003120262026003100322026202600100002011401980000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "13……？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 2400,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0031003320262026FF1F00100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦！？\n怎么成13只了……！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 2420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF01FF1F000A600E4E4862100031003353EA4E8620262026FF01FF1F00100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么办啊？\n我们已经带不了更多了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E48529E554AFF1F000A62114EEC5DF27ECF5E264E0D4E8666F4591A4E86300200100002011401980000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "请这位训练家收下它\n是不是最好的办法？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n留在这里不管的话，\n它说不定会弄脏艺术品而被处罚呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 2504,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF78FD94F4D8BAD7EC35BB665364E0B5B83000A662F4E0D662F6700597D7684529E6CD5FF1F00100001BE01000A755957288FD991CC4E0D7BA176848BDDFF0C000A5B838BF44E0D5B9A4F1A5F04810F827A672F54C1800C88AB59047F5A5462300200100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 54
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？你的盒子满了，\n好像没办法收下它哦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这样好啦，\n我就在这里看着粉蝶蛹吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F4F60768476D25B506EE14E86FF0C000A597D50CF6CA1529E6CD565364E0B5B8354E6300200100001BE01000A8FD96837597D5566FF0C000A62115C3157288FD991CC770B77407C89877686F95427300200100002011401970000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它们刚才该不会是\n一起在找第13只粉蝶蛹吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƘ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 2708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834EEC521A624D8BE54E0D4F1A662F000A4E008D775728627E7B2C0031003353EA7C89877686F95427FF1F00100002011401980000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真的太感谢你\n帮我们解决了粉蝶蛹们的问题！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƗ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
